      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrix $A$ given below.\nWhich entries of $A$ could be replaced by $0$ in order to get a matrix in row echelon form?\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 2 & 4 & 9 \\\\ 0 & -6 & -8 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
